# A run starting with a bare number ("3 days", "2 weeks") stays text, while "+3d" and an ISO date are dates.
file <<END
INBOX:
END
keys q
type Call back in 3 days
keys <Enter> q
type Renew due 2 weeks
keys <Enter> q
type Check +3d
keys <Enter> q
type Flight 2030-01-15 due 2030-01-20
keys <Enter>
quit
saved <<END
INBOX:
	- Call back in 3 days
	- Renew due 2 weeks
	- Check @start({today+3})
	- Flight @start(2030-01-15) @due(2030-01-20)
END
